<script setup lang="ts">import{computed}from 'vue';import type{CircularGroup}from '../types/domain';const props=defineProps<{a?:CircularGroup;b?:CircularGroup}>();const max=computed(()=>Math.max(.1,...[props.a,props.b].flatMap(g=>g?.histogram.flatMap(h=>[h.proportion,h.fitted_probability||0])||[]))*1.12);const xy=(angle:number,r:number)=>[240+Math.sin(angle*Math.PI/180)*r,220-Math.cos(angle*Math.PI/180)*r];function outline(g:CircularGroup|undefined,fit=false){return(g?.histogram||[]).map(h=>xy((h.lower+h.upper)/2,(fit?(h.fitted_probability||0):h.proportion)/max.value*165).join(',')).join(' ')}const rays=Array.from({length:12},(_,i)=>i*30);</script><template><figure class="polar"><div class="plot-title"><h2>跨过零点，方向仍相邻。</h2><span>每扇区30° / 概率</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 480 455" role="img" aria-label="两组流向扇区概率与von Mises描述模型的极坐标图"><g v-for="r in [41.25,82.5,123.75,165]"><circle cx="240" cy="220" :r="r" class="ring"/><text x="245" :y="220-r+12" class="axis-label">{{(max*r/165).toFixed(2)}}</text></g><line v-for="angle in rays" :x1="xy(angle,0)[0]" :y1="xy(angle,0)[1]" :x2="xy(angle,165)[0]" :y2="xy(angle,165)[1]" class="radial"/><text v-for="angle in rays" :x="xy(angle,187)[0]" :y="xy(angle,187)[1]+4" text-anchor="middle" class="axis-label">{{angle}}°</text><polygon v-if="a" :points="outline(a)" class="observed group-a"/><polygon v-if="b" :points="outline(b)" class="observed group-b"/><polygon v-if="a?.fit_status==='estimated'" :points="outline(a,true)" class="fitted group-a"/><polygon v-if="b?.fit_status==='estimated'" :points="outline(b,true)" class="fitted group-b"/><template v-for="(g,i) in [a,b]"><line v-if="g?.mean_bearing!==null&&g?.mean_bearing!==undefined" x1="240" y1="220" :x2="xy(g.mean_bearing,140*g.resultant)[0]" :y2="xy(g.mean_bearing,140*g.resultant)[1]" :class="['mean-line',i?'group-b':'group-a']"/></template><circle cx="240" cy="220" r="3" class="origin"/></svg><figcaption><span class="legend-a">— A组观测</span><span class="legend-b">— B组观测</span><span>虚线：可估单峰模型</span></figcaption><p class="plot-note">同一径向比例；线段连接扇区中点，不是时间轨迹。均值线按R相对缩放，与概率刻度不同；方向不定义时不画线。</p></figure></template>
